            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I put together this function which toggles mini.files, assigned to a key combination:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nfunction()\r\n  local miniFiles = require(\"mini.files\")\r\n  if not miniFiles.close() then\r\n    -- open file explorer if current buffer is not on disk, e.g. Starter\r\n    if vim.fn.getreg(\"%\") ~= \"\" then\r\n      miniFiles.open()\r\n    else\r\n      -- open file explorer at current file\r\n      miniFiles.open(vim.api.nvim_buf_get_name(0))\r\n    end\r\n  end\r\nend\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2024-09-09T15:35:46Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/485#issuecomment-2338448204",
